<title>SPAIN: GOLF-JAMES WINS SPANISH OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-JAMES WINS SPANISH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Mark James won the Spanish Open on Sunday, beating Australian Greg Norman at the third hole of a sudden-death playoff.</p>
</text>
